{"candidateAnswer":"go for late-night walks around the city, visit art galleries, painting cars","evidence":"[D5:8 | 1:16 pm on 3 May, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave, long drives in [this car] really help me relax. The feeling of the wind and the open road is so freeing. It helps me clear my head. What do you like to do to chill out? \n[D5:10 | 1:16 pm on 3 May, 2023] Calvin: Yea, I totally hear ya. Embracing nature has been really calming for me too. I've been loving getting to know Japanese culture. On the other hand, I'm stuck with my music at the moment, like my creativity's frozen or something. Any tips?\n[D7:5 | 6:06 pm on 31 May, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, totally! Fixing cars really calms me down and gives me a real sense of achievement - like meditating. Do you have any hobbies that give you the same satisfaction?","itemId":"urn:uuid:122297a4-d4cf-55ab-88ef-224a66dc7fb5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d4d716da34b183e5f1836e21acddc275de28be10c5262b4a6aaf31a67856a0aa","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Calvin do to relax?","referenceAnswer":"take long drives in his car, embrace nature, fixing cars","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d4d716da34b183e5f1836e21acddc275de28be10c5262b4a6aaf31a67856a0aa"}}]}